{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$30超大杯!啖啖綿滑榴槤蓉</p><p>葵芳人氣雪糕小店新推榴槤雪糕</p><p>人氣飯糰雪糕小店「阿嬤飯團」最近喺葵芳開新分店，新推出榴槤雪糕。選用新鮮金枕頭榴槤果肉製作，$30大大杯，榴槤味澎湃濃郁，啖啖都是綿滑榴槤果蓉，期間限定大約10日，榴槤迷想食就要襯早啦！</p><p>阿嬤飯團 地址: 葵芳葵富路7-11號葵涌廣場1樓潮流廊一期A號舖 官方IG：@grannys_riceball</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737846671578503_14053964436a893b254cadb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737847432276080_2628682976a893b2d31309.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737848224919354_19203902656a893b3344e53.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737848505181171_19761629966a893b35a6981.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737848754798088_9608193916a893b3829a1c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178737848979222429_13348563566a893b3a504e8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T06:18:45.161662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}